                <pb facs="0446" n="346" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg346"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>No official record of the substance of this meeting has been found. The
                    information given above with respect to the meeting and the participants is
                    taken from the Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg298">p.
                        298</ref>. See also <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg415"
                        >p. 415</ref>. According to Elliott Roosevelt, p. 157, the principal subject
                    of conversation was supply.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
